                     f"{CFG['PROJECT_TTL_DAYS']} idle days, only if fully pushed), ~/keep is never touched; servers via "
                     "`box serve`; what runs for you: `box running`; log anything about this machine that slows you down or "
                     "fails with `box issue \"...\"`. Full rules: `box rules`.")
    print("\n".join(lines))


