Example queries:
- Worst memory minutes this week: `SELECT datetime(ts,'unixepoch','localtime'), mem_used_mb, psi_mem, psi_mem_full
  FROM samples WHERE ts > strftime('%s','now','-7 days') ORDER BY psi_mem_full DESC, psi_mem DESC LIMIT 20`
